WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.250
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.850
Something's wrong.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:10.260
It's over for Soulburner.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.660
And over for me.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.190
I end my turn.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:19.430
Roboppi's AI is a housework AI.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.140
It couldn't withstand my system.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.370
That means Roboppi is...

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:36.350
Clean.  I have... to clean.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.080
I have to hurry up and clean.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:45.040
I must return to my master's room and clean.

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:51.900
That's when I'm most happy.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:59.170
Master's room holds many 
happy memories for me.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:04.690
Roboppi, you were dumb.

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:10.720
Dumb...  Dumb is a forbidden word.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.940
That's a beautiful light.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:21.260
I'm happy to be able to see this.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:28.540
Roboppi...

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:37.600
Is this a clue to Ai's whereabouts?

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:47.700
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:15.660
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:25.610
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:30.850
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:39.390
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:44.530
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:50.200
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.500
calling  With invisible wings

00:02:54.800 --> 00:03:05.110
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.520
It's a clue to Ai's whereabouts.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:29.720
Give that letter to me.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:37.730
Oh my.  How unexpected.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.430
Why is Revolver here?

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.900
Hand it over?  Why?

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:48.370
I'll take care of the Dark Ignis.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.340
You're going to defeat Ai?

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.450
Exactly.  Hand it over.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:58.340
I refuse.  I acquired this.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.420
I'm giving it to Playmaker.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:06.420
If you give it to him, he might 
not destroy the Dark Ignis.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:09.160
You don't trust Playmaker?

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:12.160
It's not about trust or no trust.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:15.170
I'm talking about certainty.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:21.670
The odds aren't zero that Playmaker 
will feel pity and let him go.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:24.680
We've already had many casualties.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:30.380
We can only end the threat to humanity 
by destroying the Dark Ignis.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:34.350
If you refuse, I'll take it by force.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.550
Revolver...

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:40.040
So you're treating us as the enemy?

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:44.710
Come to think of it, we 
haven't settled things yet.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:52.770
How about settling it right here, right now?

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:57.580
Fine.  If that's what you 
want, I'll take you on.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:01.810
If I lose, I won't take that letter.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.550
Soulburner!  Revolver!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:08.030
Playmaker, let me do this.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:11.790
Or he'll never be satisfied.

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:17.730
Don't let me win like last time.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:21.700
Back then, we needed to fight together.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:25.700
But we don't need to 
now.  I'll show no mercy.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:28.710
You talk like you've already won.

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:36.350
I'll prepare a perfect stage for your end.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:45.120
We were trapped in this facility 
during the Lost Incident.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.130
What are you doing, Revolver?

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:51.130
Psychologically pressure Takeru?

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.870
Hey.  It's becoming interesting.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.840
Everything began here.

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:02.940
There's no better place for us to end things.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.390
Our destiny's final battle.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.690
You're right.  This is the perfect setting.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.120
Soulburner...

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.520
I know, Playmaker.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:25.100
But I won't be satisfied until 
I settle things with Revolver.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:29.000
All this started because of him.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:33.340
You're right.  Time stopped for me here too.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:39.270
It's time to end everything.  And 
perhaps time to move forward.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:40.780
Revolver...

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:50.330
Here we go!  Duel!

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.860
I'm going first!

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:56.190
I summon Salamangreat Wolvie!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:03.300
I activate the spell card, Fury of Fire!

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:08.820
I can only Special Summon from 
my Extra Deck once this turn.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.820
But I can Special Summon up 
to two Salamangreats from

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:15.410
my hand or graveyard in defense 
position by negating their effects!

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:22.490
I Special Summon Salamangreat Falco 
and Salamangreat Parro from my hand!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:28.140
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:34.000
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.770
Link Summon!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:44.860
Appear, Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:49.110
Heatleo appeared.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:53.360
I set one card and end my turn!

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:56.320
Soulburner's setup is...

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:04.610
It's the same first turn as Soulburner 
and Revolver's previous duel.

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.660
Stylish.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:11.290
I'll defeat you using the 
same start as before!

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:17.780
Interesting.  Then watch how 
that duel would have ended!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.910
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:24.380
I activate the Field Spell, 
Boot Sector Launch!

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:30.120
I can Special Summon up to two Rokkets 
from my hand in defense position.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:36.860
I Special Summon Silverrokket 
Dragon and Anesthrokket Dragon!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:44.340
Due to Boot Sector Launch's effect, 
Rokkets gain 300 ATK and DEF.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:48.910
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up my path!

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:53.620
The summoning conditions are two Dragons, 
which includes a Rokket monster.

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:55.220
Link Summon!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:09:00.530
Appear, Link 2 Quadborrel Dragon!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.250
Quadborrel's effect!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:07.730
I discard a card from my 
hand to destroy a monster!

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:14.440
I discard Rokket Recharger 
and destroy Heatleo!

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.900
When this effect destroys a Link Monster...

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:25.880
...I can Special Summon a Rokket from my 
hand or graveyard

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.580
for each of its Link Markers.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.950
Heatleo is Link 3!

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.950
Come, three Rokkets!

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:38.690
Noctovision Dragon's effect 
activates from my hand!

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:43.860
When a Dark Dragon is Special 
Summoned to my field...

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:46.760
...I can Special Summon this 
card in defense position!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.500
Appear, Noctovision Dragon!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.940
Four monsters...  It's coming.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:02.380
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up my path!

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:06.820
The summoning conditions are 
at least three Effect Monsters!

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.270
Link Summon!

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:14.190
Appear!  Link 4 Borreload Dragon!

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:20.130
Borreload has shown up.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:22.700
Noctovision's effect activates!

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:26.100
When it's used to Link 
Summon, I draw one card!

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:30.290
Now Revolver has 4000 total ATK.

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.850
Soulburner has no monsters to defend him.

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.850
He works quickly as usual.

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:39.320
He plans to end him this turn.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:44.200
I see.  So this is what would've 
happened in our previous duel.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.760
I'm happy that you're fighting me seriously!

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:52.260
Battle!  Quadborrel Dragon 
attacks you directly!

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:01.830
Are you okay, Takeru?

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:06.410
If Borreload's next attack 
succeeds, Revolver wins.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.850
What a disappointing end.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.750
Here I go!

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:13.020
Borreload Dragon attacks you directly!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.600
I won't let it end this easily!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:32.080
I activate the trap card, Salamangreat Gazer!

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:36.070
I return Heatleo from my 
graveyard to my Extra Deck!

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:39.080
And until the end of this turn...

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.530
...your monster loses 1000 ATK

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:44.980
for every Link Marker that 
the monster I returned has!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.950
Heatleo has three Link Markers!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:52.220
So Borreload loses 3000 ATK!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:12:00.430
And I draw from my deck for every 
Link Monster on your field!

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.640
I took no damage!

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:07.000
All right!  He dodged it!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:11.200
It wouldn't be fun if this duel ended easily.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:15.650
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:22.390
Salamangreat Gazer's effect ends, 
so Borreload's ATK return to normal.

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:27.040
You planned to defeat me in 
one turn, but you failed!

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:30.360
It's my turn!  And I'm not holding back!

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:36.830
I'll see what kind of attack you were 
going to do in our previous duel.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.670
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:45.010
By reporting the Lost 
Incident, Revolver saved us.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:48.680
I know he's conflicted about his father.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:49.650
However...

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:57.260
I lost too much to that incident!

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:01.730
I summon Salamangreat Spinny!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.500
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.230
Link Summon!

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:14.140
Link 1 Salamangreat Balelynx!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:18.110
I activate Salamangreat 
Gazelle's effect from my hand!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:21.080
When a Salamangreat is 
sent to the graveyard,

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:24.350
I Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:30.050
Balelynx's effect activates!

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:33.040
When it's Link Summoned,

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:36.760
I add Salamangreat 
Sanctuary from my deck to my hand!

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:39.730
Then Gazelle's effect activates!

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.000
When it's Special Summoned,

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.740
I send a non-Gazelle Salamangreat 
in my deck to my graveyard!

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:50.210
I send Fusion of Fire to the graveyard!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:53.760
Then Spinny's effect activates 
from my graveyard!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:57.950
When there's a Salamangreat on the 
field, it Special Summons itself!

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.260
Appear, Spinny!

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.650
Two Level 3 monsters...

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:09.460
I use Level 3 Gazelle and Spinny 
to build the Overlay Network!

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.750
Xyz Summon!

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:35.720
The flaming wild horse that 
cuts through illusions!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:40.470
Rank 3 Salamangreat Miragestallio!

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:44.130
Miragestallio's effect activates!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:48.220
By using one Overlay Unit, I Special Summon

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:52.070
a Salamangreat from my 
deck in defense position!

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.610
Come, Salamangreat Jack Jaguar!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:15:00.780
Appear again!  The circuit 
that changes the future!

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.150
Link Summon!

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:09.050
Appear!  Link 2 Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf!

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:13.220
I'm going all out!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:19.200
Huh?  I thought Miragestallio could return 
his opponent's monster to his deck.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:24.530
Borreload can't be targeted by effects,

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:28.670
but he must not be returning 
Quadborrel on purpose.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:33.140
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:37.480
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:41.820
Appear!  Link 2 Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:46.660
Sunlight Wolf's reincarnation effect!

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:50.100
When it uses itself to Link Summon...

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:54.870
...I add a Salamangreat spell or trap 
card in my graveyard to my hand!

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.840
I return Fusion of Fire to my hand!

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:02.560
Jack Jaguar's effect activates 
from my graveyard!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:07.060
By returning Spinny to my deck, 
it Special Summons itself!

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:13.130
Sunlight Wolf's effect activates!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.620
I add Wolvie from my graveyard to my hand!

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:20.610
Due to Wolvie's effect, I return 
a card in my graveyard to my hand!

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:24.330
I return Salamangreat Gazer!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.530
Your deck is really moving.

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.170
I'm not done!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.000
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:36.840
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.210
Link Summon!

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:46.260
Appear, Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.820
Heatleo's effect activates!

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:54.560
I return a card in your Spell 
& Trap Zone to your deck!

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:57.560
Resounding Roar!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:02.600
I see.  You didn't use 
Miragestallio's effect...

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:08.270
...so you could seal my spells and 
traps and focus on Quadborrel.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:12.480
Impressive.  You know what I'm going for.

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:14.580
But I won't let you!

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:18.050
I banish Noctovision from my 
graveyard to activate its effect!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:21.840
When there's a Link Monster 
in the Extra Monster Zone...

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:27.290
...your cards can't target 
or affect my set card!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.760
What?

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:35.200
Too bad.  Heatleo's effect misfires!

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:36.930
I'm not done!

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:40.670
I activate the Field Spell, 
Salamangreat Sanctuary!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:44.690
Heatleo can use itself to reincarnate!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:51.250
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:55.700
Be reborn!  Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:02.290
Heatleo's Reincarnation Link 
Summon effect activates!

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:07.530
Quadborrel's ATK become the same 
as Balelynx's in my graveyard!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:10.500
Balelynx has 500 ATK!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.640
Flame Possession!

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:21.850
All right!  I activate the 
spell card, Fusion of Fire!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:27.850
I use monsters in the hand and field 
to Fusion Summon a Salamangreat!

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:31.390
That's another powerful card.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:33.790
I've anticipated your every move!

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:37.660
I tribute Quadborrel.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:41.400
I activate the trap card, 
Borrel Buster Barrier!

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:44.800
I equip this card on Borreload.

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:50.370
I put a counter on this card for every Link 
Marker that the tributed Quadborrel had.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:56.610
Borreload equipped with Borrel Buster 
Barrier isn't affected by effects you activate.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:00.360
So Fusion of Fire's effect also misfires.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:06.290
Oh my.  Soulburner targeted 
Quadborrel, but it vanished.

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:12.500
You should've used Miragestallio 
to return Quadborrel to my deck.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:16.050
But that's enough to stop me!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:21.720
I use Salamangreat Wolvie in my 
hand and Heatleo to Fusion Summon!

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.880
The origin of a crazy soul!

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:29.880
The magical beast whose flesh 
gathers the weapons of evil beasts!

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:31.880
Show yourself!

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:37.220
Salamangreat Violet Chimera!

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:41.330
Violet Chimera's effect activates!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:46.840
Until the end of the turn 
that it's Fusion Summoned...

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:51.800
...it gains half the ATK of the 
monsters used to summon it!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:55.760
Violet Chimera gains 2000 ATK!

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:00.980
4800 ATK...

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.480
Whoa!  Soulburner is impressive!

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:06.820
Now he has more ATK than him.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:13.090
I equip the Equip Spell, Salamangreat 
Kernel on Violet Chimera!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:19.540
Battle!  Violet Chimera attacks Borreload!

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:23.490
Kernel's effect!

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:29.970
Your monster that battles my equipped 
monster loses 800 ATK during battle!

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.440
What?

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.650
Nice, Takeru!

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:39.730
At this moment, Borreload's effect activates.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:44.120
One monster loses 500 ATK and DEF.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:49.090
You can't activate a card effect 
against this effect's activation!

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:51.560
Anti Enemy Varrett!

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:56.500
But there's much more to my attack!

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:01.610
Violet Chimera's additional effect activates!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:08.050
When it battles a monster whose ATK are 
different than its original points, its ATK double!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:11.180
8600 ATK...

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:13.650
If this succeeds, it's over.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.620
Borrel Buster Barrier's effect activates!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:21.360
By using one counter, 
battle damage is halved!

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:31.090
But the battle ends, so Violet 
Chimera's effect is gone.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:36.510
I set one card and end my turn!

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:41.250
You failed to shave away all my LP.

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:46.980
But I destroyed your ace monster 
and shaved away a lot of LP!

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:52.420
So that's the best your attack could do.

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:54.430
Like I thought, you'll now lose!

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:09.620
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:17.070
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:24.070
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.300 --> 00:22:27.030
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:34.540
The next sentimental

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:45.800
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:52.240
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.730 --> 00:22:57.460
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.630 --> 00:23:07.820
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:13.250
Are you ready?

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:18.600
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:23.820
Are you ready?

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:30.910
Are you ready?

00:23:37.590 --> 00:23:40.430
The rain at the source of the Lost Incident

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:45.560
squeezes Takeru's heart, reminding 
him of his dead parents.

00:23:46.060 --> 00:23:50.910
Revolver may have chosen 
this location to tell

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:53.980
Soulburner that the rain eventually stops.

00:23:54.400 --> 00:24:00.520
Revolver, you chose to become 
Soulburner's greatest test?

